      "title": "Systematic Review Protocol: Efficacy and Safety of Wuwei Xiaodu Drink for Wound Infection (2022)",
      "description": "This systematic review protocol was registered to evaluate the clinical evidence for Wu Wei Xiao Du Yin in treating wound infections. The authors noted that while the formula has been widely used clinically with reported good results, high-level evidence was lacking, prompting a formal systematic review across seven databases.",
